An ingest whose append_entries fails, with no memory to publish the degraded
state, leaves the engine writable with the chunks it wrote in the file: the
flag that makes the outer handler refuse is set only after the append returns.
Reverts #618.
Guarded-by: "alloc sweep: ingest whose append fails"

